e":"inlineMath","value":"n-1"},{"type":"text","value":" 个位置中选择 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"m-1"},{"type":"text","value":" 个位置。方案数："},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"C(n-1,m-1)"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"011 小球无区别、盒子有区别、允许有空盒"}],"identifier":"heading-011-小球无区别-盒子有区别-允许有空盒"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"由于允许空盒，根据前面的分析，挡板可以相邻。所以问题等价于，在 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"n+m-1"},{"type":"text","value":" 个位置中放置 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"m-1"},{"type":"text","value":" 块挡板。方案数："},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"C(n+m-1,m-1)"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"100 小球有区别、盒子无区别、不允许空盒"}],"identifier":"heading-100-小球有区别-盒子无区别-不允许空盒"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"设方案数 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"f(n,m)"},{"type":"text","value":"。讨论任一小球 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"b_i"},{"type":"text","value":" 的摆放情况，则所有的方案分为两类："}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"orderType":"1","start":1,"marker":46,"spread":true,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"b_i"},{"type":"text","value":" 独占一个盒子；相当于其它 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"n-1"},{"type":"text","value":" 个不同球需要放入 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"m-1"},{"type":"text","value":" 个相同盒子且不允许空盒。方案数："},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"f(n-1,m-1)"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"b_i"},{"type":"text","value":" 不独占一个盒子; 相当于先把 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"n-1"},{"type":"text","value":" 个不同球放入 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 个相同盒子且不允许空盒，再将 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"b_i"},{"type":"text","value":" 放入任一盒子中。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"根据组合数的加法原理，总结以上两种情况，可得到递推式："}]},{"type":"math","val